sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CI as CI/CD Runner
    participant API as git-logs/v2 API
    participant V as Validator
    participant DB as SQLite Root DB
    participant AUD as AuditTrail

    Note over CI,API: POST /append-log (chunked)
    CI->>API: RepoUrl, RootRepo, Branch, TempToken, Token,<br/>PipelineName, GitSha256, Logs[], ErrorLogs[], HasError
    API->>V: parse RepoUrl, locate GitProfile
    V->>V: Acceptance check (AcceptAllRepos / Selected / SelectedAllVersions)
    V->>V: Branch restriction (IsRestrictInBranch + StrictBranch)
    V->>V: TempToken match -> Profile
    V->>V: Token same Profile, Profile Active, App Active
    alt Validation passes
        API->>DB: upsert Pipeline; insert LogEntry and ErrorLogEntry
        API->>DB: if HasError: Pipeline.HasError=1
        API->>DB: insert History(ActionType=Append) and Action
        API->>AUD: AuditActionType=LogPush, Outcome=Success
        API-->>CI: 200 { Status: Success, TraceId, Retrieval }
    else Rejected
        API->>AUD: AuditActionType=LogPush/AuthFail, Outcome=Rejected
        API-->>CI: 4xx { ErrorCode: GL-..., TraceId }
    end

    Note over CI,API: PUT /fixed-log
    CI->>API: RepoUrl, Branch, TempToken, RootRepo, Token, PipelineName
    API->>V: same validation chain
    API->>DB: Pipeline.HasError=0; History(Fixed) and Action
    API->>AUD: LogPush/Fixed Success
    API-->>CI: 200 ack

    Note over CI,API: POST /clear-log
    CI->>API: same body as fixed-log
    API->>DB: delete LogEntry and ErrorLogEntry for Pipeline
    API->>DB: History(Clear) and Action
    API-->>CI: 200 ack

    Note over CI,API: POST /clear-log-all
    CI->>API: RepoUrl, Branch, TempToken, RootRepo, Token (no PipelineName)
    API->>DB: delete logs for all pipelines on (RepoVersion, Branch)
    API->>DB: History(ClearAll) and Action
    API-->>CI: 200 ack
